  message: "Shipped via PR #3823 (merged at 4549106aec). linkers/js_module.py now uses make_file_id(lang, rel_path) for emitted file Symbol ids (canonical :1-1:file:file shape), make_file_stable_id for stable_id, and a pre-pass existing_file_symbol_by_canonical_id map for cross-producer dedup against orchestrator-synthesized canonical file Symbols. _make_module_file_id helper removed. Dogfood: 5 → 0 duplicate file Symbols on htrac-frontend .ts paths in hypergumbo self-analysis; js-module-linker-v1 now emits 0 file Symbols total (every resolved import target reuses existing canonical). Three new tests in TestInvMovorCanonicalFileIdReuse pin the fix. Full suite: 2552 passed; 100% coverage. Test fixture in test_route_handler_linker.py:2143 updated from legacy id to canonical."  # 9782
