  message: "REOPENED as violated (owner-approved 2026-11-01). Live at dev 100b6fbb6e, `hypergumbo survey` on ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/misc3/fx_modan: every .svelte/.vue path carries two file-kind Symbols: src/App.svelte -> javascript: + svelte:, src/App.vue -> javascript: + vue:, src/Kid.vue -> vue: + javascript:, and src/Child.svelte -> javascript: + vue: (a vue:-language id on a .svelte file). This contradicts the statement 'one file-kind Symbol per path'. The 2026-05-19 js_module fix for .ts paths still holds; this is a different producer pair (the javascript analyzer and the SFC analyzers both emit a file node). Also recorded on WI-modan point 5."  # 7cea
